      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `67b064cca3fc955e79231bedfaa44d47ea97eff7814a9b7b85beaf591faa4bd8--45100do003_2010.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2010\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 16 of 16\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | ce8478f9873995ccc36d0a6e5a7205a0b9300623af4ef8448c43ced1fc764dd3 | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | 799dcb09b2578046333643b8901cd38b7ee7dedf0e6efaf25e6a7ff23efbdabc | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | 9d4f9473fad9f8e1ec43e8aa302c8934c3221acb11cfc53b0523b30e9c9966b6 | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | e45b57e6335182adb0279fc253361a58c4add8e9ada2aa1867e95932c1754d7f | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | 9b068215fdf1cecf02a1b87dc807963d774426cfc712c7be118bcdaa1bb50c3e | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | 6977049dee044b1d92e5b23ad01012982e8c6d616dadbd1259842ddfd1237858 | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | 63958c3e554cd3b870425f431314dc5c3b35ddfb9acae83529bf9df49a9f70c4 | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | bbd3f75bd86fc80de2e39e1ab58dfdfcfc21f5b48817b31a6b98c4909f8901c2 | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | e37f44aad957755f50d2f1586965ad1742d4ba4313314a30897dd4ce3de8ad75 | missing |\n| \"Table_9\" | de2c88b50ec6e8bf93f741efc840e0abccccb78451b4ed5e85f999211deee487 | missing |\n| \"Table_10\" | e7c4ae4d3e3d21e33b379c1d3b2869f829ab3936c37c312cacf1198568118b96 | missing |\n| \"Table_11\" | a223b9347b03a116bc9c9416cf291a03422b7c4fa1e198056a8092e45661388d | missing |\n| \"Table_12\" | 1afe81edfb65cd6f35083cde7484cf755c5ce239171524cd3c9f10301194d726 | missing |\n| \"Table_13\" | d89319d59028c1c54b8ee5c143a19b54dfb17fb8df44bce9df2753e54930e54b | missing |\n| \"Table_14\" | 29f0d50a450142d9721f138f4547233ef203a2848db42e5cef5f54f9453b23e4 | missing |\n| \"Table_15\" | 19c1c28069696b860337cd53ba35316c334f6b9523a473c0bf34a58a3e1cd49f | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
